  <item>
    <title>找啊找啊找工作：一场五味杂陈的心灵之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66617f7963c334a2fbca13fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66617f7963c334a2fbca13fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jun 2024 09:20:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为劳动人民，生存的第一要务是好好劳动，然而对于现代毕业生，想要进入就业市场还没那么容易，养鱼的HR、疯狂的竞争者、野蛮的实习lerader，过五关斩六将后，求职者们的归宿在何方。本期我们邀请了两位择业中的朋友，听她们讲讲择业过程中的喜怒哀乐～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【逗留指引】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 实习时的离谱经历：遭遇原始人leader😱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 面试时的性格测试～怎么感觉怎么选都不对🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 对于应届生，第一份工作有那么重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 反其道而行之？还有老板最爱小白。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 面试中最讨厌的环节——群面——专属于E人的猎杀时刻😨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2727">45:27</a> 面试：线下线上还真不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer's Here-Thomas</span></p><span></span><p><span>O-FKJ</span></p><span></span><p><span>First Gymnopedie-Eddie Daniels</span></p><span></span><p><span>monday-窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><span>Feel Good Inc.-Gorillaz/De La Soul</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：苗苗/yaoyao</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：陌一/小年</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果希望与我们联络或向我们投稿，欢迎你通过以下方式找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮：douliuyihui@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠：逗留一会</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听平台】小宇宙|网易云音乐|荔枝|喜马拉雅搜索：逗留一会，同步播放~</span></p>]]></description>
