  <item>
    <title>五感中的年味：回忆中的年味都从何而来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bf6cde0847349e0cedb615</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bf6cde0847349e0cedb615</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Feb 2024 10:54:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好啊，今天是大年廿五，春节的钟声还有五天就要敲响，不知道此刻的你身处何处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目，苗苗和yaoyao一起回溯了记忆中度过的那些新年，试图描绘新年中那些最重要的时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲爱的朋友，不管你身在何处，在哪里度过新年，期盼你在新的一年，遇见更多美好，收获更多奇迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 你家过年会上贡吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 皮孩子的花式放炮：🧨炸💩坑？是谁教你们的！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 亲爱的年轻人，你开始春节焦虑了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 白炽灯照亮的院子给了童年难得的安逸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 年年翻车年年不死心，今年过年你烫头了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> 从收红包—〉发红包：新工作的年轻人的新负担</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">41:55</a> 再看更多的烟花，好像都没有小时候好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> 又要心意还不能抄袭，拜年短信就像毕业论文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2796">46:36</a> 节日是提醒我们时间流逝的标志，请这样一年一年地过下去</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1,2,3,4,5-Prinzhorn Dance School</span></p><span></span><p><span>难忘今宵-李谷一</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer's Here-Thomas Greenberg</span></p><span></span><p><span>Monday-窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>主播：苗苗/yaoyao</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>如果希望与我们联络或向我们投稿，欢迎你通过以下方式找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮：douliuyihui@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠：逗留一会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhmKnqp1ahBygkxHIno5mQUfo9jS.m4a" length="49020544" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:31</itunes:duration>
