  <item>
    <title>年会不能停？年会可以停！职场新生如何扮演好领导play的一环～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b3cdbccace72dff82a631a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b3cdbccace72dff82a631a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jan 2024 15:20:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年会就是加班排练舞蹈，让领导开心一下罢了～打工人始终是领导Play的一环，三个职场小白来聊聊职场那些事，我们将从《年会不能停!》这部电影出发,延伸到讽刺的职场现象与职场小白的困境~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> &nbsp;聊聊老东家 ，董小姐提议员工跳槽要给前公司赔偿金，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;孟羽童事件好像撕下了半掩着的事实：公司和员工始终是对立的，世界打工人联合起 </span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;来抗争不良老板！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> &nbsp;真正要对齐颗粒度的是公司与员工吧，领导永远不会跟下属对齐颗粒度，这个颗粒度 </span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;到底是谁在对齐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> &nbsp;报告！当好坏领导的3个小妙招，现实中每个领导已熟练掌握!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> &nbsp;加班那些事~ 加班是彰显工作态度的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> &nbsp;工作后只有两件期盼的事情 -发工资和放假，钱多活少的工作就是开心的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> &nbsp;工作好像不需要那么多创造力，更多的是琐碎组成，而初入职场的我们怀着的理想主 </span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;义，是最多余的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> &nbsp;好好的福利待遇变成当冤大头，被迫花钱上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">38:34</a> &nbsp;打工人的焦虑大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> &nbsp;离职潮也是有规律的，至少领完年终奖在离职~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;白天彩排年会节目，晚上加班做工作。只让领导开心的年会可以停一停了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fuck This Job-Wheeler Walker Jr.-</span></p><span></span><p><span>sum-fsb02takuya</span></p><span></span><p><span>我杀了星期一-SAM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer's Here-Thomas Greenberg</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>主播：苗苗/yaoyao &nbsp;嘉宾：冰冰</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>如果希望与我们联络或向我们投稿，欢迎你通过以下方式找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮：douliuyihui@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠：逗留一会</span></p>]]></description>
