  <item>
    <title>怪癖？❌明明是闪光点！生活怪癖大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659fb4e6b5e4856c7066b523</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659fb4e6b5e4856c7066b523</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jan 2024 09:29:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生活中我们总有些古怪的小习惯，一些没来由的执着或特别的喜好。本期我们一起来聊聊这些特别的习惯，看看这些“怪癖”如何将我们塑造成多姿多彩的人类。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 为了睡个好觉😴，我们做了哪些努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 一种优良传统——中国人奇妙的收集癖～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 对连号纸币的钟情到底是从哪里来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 保留学生时期的小纸条像保留下了青春🥹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> &nbsp;不剩🍚是优良传统，也可能成为生活负担</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> &nbsp;出门一定要带本书？万一我想看了呢😚！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> &nbsp;外出拍照📷or不拍，请选择你喜欢的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> &nbsp;一个“一边享受live一边记录”的小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> &nbsp;怪癖让我们发现自己的特殊时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Monday-窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><span>sum-fsb02takuya</span></p><span></span><p><span>向日葵-大桥优子</span></p><span></span><p><span>像你这样的朋友-陆虎</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后一首歌送给我们的好朋友洋洋~下次再见~</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>主播：苗苗/yaoyao 嘉宾：洋洋</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>如果希望与我们联络或向我们投稿，欢迎你通过以下方式找到我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮：douliuyihui@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠：逗留一会</span></p>]]></description>
